# Five starts of the unit in a row with nobody at it, the front after
# each (info 4 bit 0: the faceplate answers; the port with its reset
# line), and the faceplate's messages for ten seconds.
front on
info 4
restart
front on
info 4
r32 ff909004
wait 10000
info 4
restart
front on
info 4
r32 ff909004
wait 10000
info 4
restart
front on
info 4
r32 ff909004
wait 10000
info 4
restart
front on
info 4
r32 ff909004
wait 10000
info 4
restart
front on
info 4
r32 ff909004
wait 10000
info 4
